# Design skill bind

When Product Designer (`product-designer`, @Design) runs, or the user asks for UI/UX/visual/sidebar/dashboard/landing work:

1. Read `design-stack`, `premium-ui-craft`, `ux-web-research`, `landing-page-design`, and `redesign-existing-projects` under `~/.cursor/skills/`.
2. Premium-ui-craft stays on every Design turn. Elaya landing/redesign apply per design-stack (marketing vs in-app).
3. CoS briefs to Design must name those skills.
